      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one forward action per view, accent-filled with a trailing arrow.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">Open shop plan <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
