      "description": "Paper-white sheet in Primary-navy ink; numbered step with its plate.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-sheet\"><header class=\"ds-sheet-h\"><h2>Shop plan</h2><p>Before The Heat</p></header><div class=\"ds-step\"><span class=\"ds-step-n\">1</span><span class=\"ds-step-plate\"></span><div><p class=\"ds-step-t\">Case Opal White in Gold Ruby</p><p class=\"ds-step-d\">Opal White at the centre, with Gold Ruby gathered over it, pulled as one cane.</p></div></div></article>",
